  "description": "This phrase is a coded or ambiguous reference to the exclusion of white perspectives or white people from a particular context, often used in discussions about diversity, representation, or social justice. It implies a deliberate omission or marginalization of white voices or experiences, which can be interpreted as promoting exclusionary ideologies. The phrase is not a direct visual element but relies on real-world understanding of racial dynamics and discourse around representation.",
